{"ID":"20240205153648-6sryvca","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153648-6sryvca","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153648-6sryvca\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091337-91yxuit\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163950-x1l1ymy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091337-91yxuit\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"前胡","type":"doc","updated":"20240913160053"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091337-91yxuit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091337-91yxuit","updated":"20240206091346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江、四川、湖南等地。\n【性状】\t白花前胡：根近圆柱形、圆锥形或纺锤形，稍扭曲，下部有分枝，长约315cm，直径12cm。根头部常有茎痕及纤维状叶鞘残基；表面灰棕色至黑褐色，有不规则纵沟及纵皱纹，并有横向皮孔；上部有密集的环纹。质较柔软，干者质硬，可折断，折断面不整齐，疏松，于放大镜下可邮众多细小黄棕色油点散在；皮部厚，淡黄白色，形成层环明显，木部淡黄色。气芳香，味微苦、辛。\n紫花前胡：根头部较粗短，根少有纤维状叶鞘残基。折断面皮部易与木部分离。气芳香，味微苦、辛。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t宣散风热，降气化痰。用于治疗风热感冒、咳嗽痰多、咯痰黄稠等症。\n【注解】\t“蚯蚓头”：指药材根头部具有明显密集的环纹，如同蚯蚓的头部。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091338-d60rvvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091338-d60rvvh","updated":"20240206091338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091338-vifnxfm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163950-x1l1ymy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163950-x1l1ymy","updated":"20240205163950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"前胡"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/前胡-20240205163950-jdadorg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710111640-byrzrnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710111640-byrzrnl","updated":"20240710111643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白花前胡"}]},{"ID":"20240710110519-xsfs804","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710110519-xsfs804","updated":"20240710111119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 431px;","style":"width: 421px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"前胡"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/前胡-20240710110519-ht248wa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 421px;\" parent-style=\"width: 431px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 398px;","style":"width: 388px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"前胡 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/前胡 3-20240710110749-eorvtas.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 388px;\" parent-style=\"width: 398px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 379px;","style":"width: 369px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"前胡 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/前胡 7-20240710111119-hljk6os.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 369px;\" parent-style=\"width: 379px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710110555-95g63ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"